Package: quantum-browser
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libx11-6, libgtk-3-0, libasound2
Description: High-performance web browser powered by Mozilla Gecko
 Quantum Browser is an open-source web browser featuring the Mozilla
 Gecko desktop rendering engine, pre-bundled uBlock Origin WebExtension,
 multi-tab management, and strict local-only privacy controls.
 Zero telemetry, zero analytics.
